### Fazer login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:40000/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Listar todos os pastos
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPasto
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Buscar pasto por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getPastoByID/2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Cadastrar pasto
POST http://localhost:40000/insertPasto
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "descricao": "Pasto Principal",
    "areatotal": 50.00,
    "ativo": true
}

### Atualizar pasto
PUT http://localhost:40000/updatePasto/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "descricao": "Pasto Principal Atualizado",
    "areatotal": 60.00,
    "ativo": true
}

### Excluir pasto
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deletePasto/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}